{"4068230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VOID PRIEST", "steam_appid": 4068230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Void Priest. Bound to an Elder God against your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovecraftian psychological detective horror told through rituals, relics, and madness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to prepare the world for its arrival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice is whether to obey or betray.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068230/extras/043a2e12193c396e4b7a3a3c6d79f860.poster.avif?t=1786389761\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068230/extras/043a2e12193c396e4b7a3a3c6d79f860.webm?t=1786389761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068230/extras/043a2e12193c396e4b7a3a3c6d79f860.mp4?t=1786389761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World Without Screens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No HUD, no menus. Every signal lives inside the world itself.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A candle's bloom is your health and sanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symbols in the book shift as your understanding grows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics are tools that carry truths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068230/extras/1fbb8905570cf6af1e4aea05cff57379.poster.avif?t=1786389761\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068230/extras/1fbb8905570cf6af1e4aea05cff57379.webm?t=1786389761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068230/extras/1fbb8905570cf6af1e4aea05cff57379.mp4?t=1786389761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Detective of the Unknowable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You serve, and you investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, read people and the world like a puzzle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect fragments of evidence on your board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal what hides behind reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decipher the forbidden language to open doors no one should.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068230/extras/2cde97450c5fb59154da0645e5639e70.poster.avif?t=1786389761\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068230/extras/2cde97450c5fb59154da0645e5639e70.webm?t=1786389761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068230/extras/2cde97450c5fb59154da0645e5639e70.mp4?t=1786389761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endure What Hunts You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters are endured, never fought. Survival means completing the rite before your mind collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your relics define your path.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068230/extras/cddf5dfc8a500976d45967d7f5089c50.avif?t=1786389761\" width=1170 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Knowledge Is Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No numbers, no bars. Progress lives in what you understand and what it costs you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solved mysteries sharpen your perception and bend the world your way. Each revelation takes a piece of your sanity as payment.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068230/extras/cbe530c5f2243ede19705cb41b8409cd.avif?t=1786389761\" width=1170 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endings Carved in Madness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions carve the ending. Replay to reach the others.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martyrdom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrupted Immortality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068230/extras/3c7e349d6faf83e63c13afc588a1a819.avif?t=1786389761\" width=1170 height=70 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovecraftian psychological detective horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is the interface. No HUD, no menus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal text and voice. Symbols and the world itself do the talking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Context-aware controls with zero menu transitions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lo-fi visuals, heavy atmosphere, runs on weak PCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival through knowledge and rituals, not combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endings shaped by your choices and what your sanity survives</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Void Priest. Bound to an Elder God against your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovecraftian psychological detective horror told through rituals, relics, and madness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to prepare the world for its arrival.</p><p 